data: {"id": "e124fa470bfd48bd-thinking-parallel_evidence-1803", "run_id": "e124fa470bfd48bd", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已采集事实（支持/反驳）\n\n**1. Kubernetes Describe 确认的实体状态**\n- **Pod 身份**: `aiops-case-v15/workload`, UID=`da351bf0-c4ab-47a0-b24d-7c7a75950753`, 节点 `node2`\n- **当前状态**: Running（但容器处于 CrashLoopBackOff Waiting）\n- **容器 app 状态**:\n  - **Last State**: Terminated, Reason=`OOMKilled`, Exit Code=`137`, 运行时间仅 ~1秒 (Started: 11:35:08 → Finished: 11:35:09)\n  - **Current State**: Waiting, Reason=`CrashLoopBackOff`\n  - **Restart Count**: 30次\n  - **重启事件**: BackOff 警告持续 129分钟（580次）\n- **容器资源限制**: `Limits: cpu=10", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789385781922, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

